Z||000000||BAM-BAM||03-13-2000||10:40 PM||||  For the fist time in three years my 85GT passed smog without taking it to the dealer and letting them cheat the system <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif">. I owe it all to YOU-THE FORUM. I've learned more about working on my Fiero from the forum than the dealership mechanics. Last year, they told me to get rid of it, it was over the hill. They said there were to many problems to fix it. They wanted me to pay them $1800.00 to get my engine running <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif">; I did it(with your help) for a little less than $300.00 <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">. And, everything on the car works; pwr windows, pwr doorlocks, tilt, cruise, oops, I forgot, the pwr mirrors are out of commision(for now). but that too will get fixed. I'm sure, with your help, it will be done. This is too great; EVERYONE, stand and take a bow, I salute you, each and every one of you. my deepest thanks.  You all have turned me into a Fieroholic and believe me it's nice to have a hobby again <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.<P>  THANX, THANX, THANX<BR>   BAM-BAM <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P> P.S. I almost sold my car two months ago for $300.00. Now, to me, it's priceless. Ok, there might be a price out there <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||6
