Z||000003||BAM-BAM||03-14-2000||09:17 PM||||     Tom, All I did was replace a few sensors<BR>and a basic tune-up. I replaced the TPS, O2 sensor, plug wires, plugs, PCV valve, new cap<BR>and rotor, oil change <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif">. I had to replace my EGR tube(mine was crushed) and my EGR vacuum regulator(mine was missing) and BAM!!, it passed. My car was a headache untill I found the forum. These guys have made it easier to get the work done and saved me alot alot of money.<BR>  Be Cool <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>  BAM-BAM||||reg||6
